      "solution": "Cỡ mẫu <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Tứ phân vị thứ nhất thuộc nhóm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>65</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>55</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Tứ phân vị thứ hai (trung vị) thuộc nhóm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>65</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>90</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>65</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>≈</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>685</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Tứ phân vị thứ ba thuộc nhóm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>115</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>18</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>17</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>95</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Khoảng tứ ph